      "writtenOn": "2024-03-28T22:22:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nice catch Ben.\n\nI\u0027ve submitted a fix for this at [fontations#863](https://github.com/googlefonts/fontations/pull/863). Specifically, it does what you suggest and computes size based on two entries. After this patch lands, the code on the Skia side can be changed to check if `location.data_size \u003d\u003d Some(0)` to detect empty bitmaps.\n\nFor format 1, it looks like metrics are supposed to be in the CBDT/EBDT table so we won\u0027t have any available for empty glyphs.",
      "parentUuid": "ab40433e_ff9d64d6",
      "revId": "cf7fefd0bbfbf0189b67af6f57963cb36fa890ec",
